at('Sensor read: ',  /data/sensor_configuration/config_read_mode , ' / ',  /data/methodmesh_sensor_result/actual_device_id )" nodeset="/data/meta/instanceName" type="string"/></model></h:head><h:body class="pages"><input ref="/data/introduction"><label>MethodMesh sensor-read example</label><hint>This demonstration form launches the MethodMesh sensor.read capability as an ODK external application. Configure the read on the first page, then press Launch on the MethodMesh result page.</hint></input><group appearance="field-list" ref="/data/sensor_configuration"><label>Sensor configuration</label><select1 appearance="minimal" ref="/data/sensor_configuration/config_read_mode"><label>Read mode</label><hint>Single reads one sample; average and trace read repeatedly; discover scans for nearby registered MethodMesh sensors.</hint><item><label>Single point read</label><value>single</value></item><item><label>Average over time</label><value>average</value></item><item><label>Trace over time</label><value>trace</value></item><item><label>Discover nearby sensors</label><value>discover</value></item></select1><input ref="/data/sensor_configuration/config_device_id"><label>Registered device ID</label><hint>For example clinic_room_01_sensor. Leave blank to choose a nearby sensor. Discover mode does not require a device ID.</hint></input><input ref="/data/sensor_configuration/config_sensor_id"><label>Sensor ID</label><hint>Optional channel or sensor identifier, for example radar_1.</hint></input><input ref="/data/sensor_configuration/config_sensor_profile"><label>Sensor profile</label><hint>Optional firmware profile, for example aht20.</hint></input><select1 appearance="minimal" ref="/data/sensor_configuration/config_match_policy"><label>Device matching policy</label><hint>Fallback permits operator substitution; strict fails when the requested device is absent; any_nearby accepts any nearby MethodMesh sensor.</hint><item><label>Fallback: choose nearby if requested device is absent</label><value>fallback</value></item><item><label>Strict: fail if requested device is absent</label><value>strict</value></item><item><label>Any nearby MethodMesh sensor</label><value>any_nearby</value></item></select1><input ref="/data/sensor_configuration/config_duration_seconds"><label>Duration in seconds</label><hint>Used only for average and trace modes.</hint></input><input ref="/data/sensor_configuration/config_interval_seconds"><label>Sample interval in seconds</label><hint>Used only for average and trace modes.</hint></input></group><group appearance="field-list" intent="com.example.methodmesh.EXECUTE_METHOD(method_id='sensor.read',input_device_id= /data/sensor_configuration/config_device_id ,input_sensor_id= /data/sensor_configuration/config_sensor_id ,input_sensor_profile= /data/sensor_configuration/config_sensor_profile ,input_sensor_read_mode= /data/sensor_configuration/config_read_mode ,input_duration_seconds= /data/sensor_configuration/config_duration_seconds ,input_sample_interval_seconds= /data/sensor_configuration/config_interval_seconds ,input_device_match_policy= /data/sensor_configuration/config_match_policy ,return_mode='flat')" ref="/data/methodmesh_sensor_result"><label>Run MethodMesh sensor</label><input ref="/data/methodmesh_sensor_result/sensor_read_status"><label>Read status</label><hint>Expected values: succeeded, failed, or discovered.</hint></input><input ref="/data/methodmesh_sensor_result/sensor_read_mode"><label>Mode used</label></input><input ref="/data/methodmesh_sensor_result/requested_device_id"><label>Requested device ID</label></input><input ref="/data/methodmesh_sensor_result/actual_device_id"><label>Actual device ID</label></input><input ref="/data/methodmesh_sensor_result/device_name"><label>Device name</label></input><input ref="/data/methodmesh_sensor_result/device_address"><label>BLE device address</label></input><input ref="/data/methodmesh_sensor_result/requested_sensor_id"><label>Requested sensor ID</label></input><inp