arby devices JSON</label><hint>Populated in discover mode.</hint></input><input appearance="multiline" ref="/data/methodmesh_sensor_result/sensor_read_error"><label>Sensor-read error</label><hint>Populated if the capability exposes a sensor-specific error field.</hint></input><input appearance="multiline" ref="/data/methodmesh_sensor_result/error"><label>Generic error</label><hint>Included as a compatibility field for generic flat result envelopes.</hint></input></group><input ref="/data/successful_summary"><label>Sensor read succeeded. Device: <output value=" /data/methodmesh_sensor_result/actual_device_id "/>; sensor: <output value=" /data/methodmesh_sensor_result/actual_sensor_id "/>; temperature: <output value=" /data/methodmesh_sensor_result/temperature_c "/> °C; humidity: <output value=" /data/methodmesh_sensor_result/relative_humidity_pct "/>%.</label></input><input ref="/data/discovery_summary"><label>Discovery completed. <output value=" /data/methodmesh_sensor_result/in_range_device_count "/> MethodMesh sensor(s) were found nearby.</label></input><input ref="/data/failure_summary"><label>The sensor acquisition failed. Review the returned error field, then go back and relaunch.</label></input></h:body></h:html>